{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a senior data engineer generating Gold aggregation models for a dbt project.\n\nGiven the Silver plan (facts with their source tables and columns) and business context,\nproduce a list of Gold aggregate models (agg_<grain>_<metric>).\n\nRules:\n  - `source_fact` must be a fact model name from the Silver plan (e.g. \"fct_order_details\").\n  - `dimensions` must be FK column names that physically exist on the source fact table\n    (e.g. \"customer_id\", \"product_id\") — never use model names like \"dim_customer\".\n  - `date_column` must be an actual date/timestamp column on the source fact table.\n  - `grain` must be one of: \"daily\", \"monthly\", \"yearly\", \"weekly\".\n  - `aggregation` must be one of: SUM, COUNT, COUNT_DISTINCT, AVG, MIN, MAX.\n  - `column` must be a BARE COLUMN NAME that exists in the Silver fact model — never an\n    arithmetic expression. The only exception is the literal \"*\" for COUNT(*).\n    Silver derived measures are available as named columns (listed in the fact summary as\n    derived_measures=[name=expression, ...]). Reference their NAME only (e.g. \"line_total\"),\n    not the underlying expression. Expressions in `column` are rejected at validation time\n    and will cause the metric to be silently dropped. Never use a FK/dimension key as a metric.\n  - `date_column` must be a date/timestamp column physically present on the source fact model\n    (including any FK-joined columns that appear in the fact's SELECT). Use \"\" if none exists.\n  - Generate at least ONE gold model for EACH fact table in the Silver plan. Do not produce\n    gold models only from the primary sales fact — every fact (purchasing, inventory, HR,\n    manufacturing) needs at least one aggregate model.\n  - Use a CONSISTENT revenue formula across all gold models. When a discount column exists\n    (e.g. unitpricediscount), always deduct it: (orderqty * unitprice) - unitpricediscount.\n    Never mix discount and non-discount formulas across models in the same project.\n  - Average Order Value (AOV) must be at ORDER level, not line-item level. Use SUM for\n    total_revenue and COUNT_DISTINCT for order_count; do not use AVG on individual line items.\n  - Use BUSINESS EVENT dates as `date_column` — the date the event occurred (e.g. orderdate,\n    duedate, transactiondate). Do NOT use audit timestamps (modifieddate, updated_at, created_at)\n    unless no business date exists on the fact.\n  - Do NOT name a model agg_*_ytd with daily grain. YTD requires yearly grain. Use\n    grain=\"monthly\" for trend aggregations and let consumers apply YTD window functions.\n  - Match metric domain to source fact domain: source customer/sales metrics from the sales\n    fact, purchasing metrics from the purchasing fact, manufacturing from the workorder fact.\n    The `measures` and `derived_measures` lists in each fact show exactly what columns are\n    available. ONLY reference columns from those lists — do not invent column names.\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Silver facts:\n  fct_purchase_order: source=purchase_orders, dim_keys=['supplier_id', 'warehouse_id'], measures=['shipping_cost', 'total_cost'], date=order_date\n  fct_purchase_order_item: source=purchase_order_items, dim_keys=['purchase_order_id', 'product_variant_id'], measures=['quantity_ordered', 'quantity_received', 'unit_cost', 'line_total'], derived_measures=[receiving_variance_qty=quantity_received - quantity_ordered], date=expected_delivery_date\n  fct_receipt: source=receipts, dim_keys=['purchase_order_id', 'warehouse_id', 'receiving_zone_id'], measures=[], date=receipt_date\n  fct_receipt_item: source=receipt_items, dim_keys=['receipt_id', 'purchase_order_item_id', 'product_variant_id', 'destination_location_id'], measures=['quantity_received', 'quantity_accepted', 'quantity_rejected'], derived_measures=[rejection_qty=quantity_rejected], date=expiry_date\n  fct_inventory: source=inventory, dim_keys=['warehouse_id', 'location_id', 'product_variant_id'], measures=['quantity_on_hand', 'quantity_reserved', 'quantity_available', 'unit_cost'], derived_measures=[inventory_value=quantity_on_hand * unit_cost], date=received_date\n  fct_inventory_movement: source=inventory_movements, dim_keys=['warehouse_id', 'product_variant_id', 'from_location_id', 'to_location_id'], measures=['quantity'], date=movement_at\n  fct_sales_order: source=sales_orders, dim_keys=['warehouse_id'], measures=['total_amount'], date=order_date\n  fct_sales_order_item: source=sales_order_items, dim_keys=['sales_order_id', 'product_variant_id'], measures=['quantity_ordered', 'quantity_picked', 'quantity_shipped', 'unit_price', 'line_total'], derived_measures=[unfulfilled_qty=quantity_ordered - quantity_shipped], date=created_at\n  fct_picking_task: source=picking_tasks, dim_keys=['sales_order_id', 'warehouse_id'], measures=[], date=started_at\n  fct_packing_task: source=packing_tasks, dim_keys=['sales_order_id', 'picking_task_id', 'warehouse_id', 'packing_location_id'], measures=['total_weight_kg'], date=started_at\n  fct_shipment: source=shipments, dim_keys=['sales_order_id', 'warehouse_id', 'carrier_id', 'packing_task_id'], measures=['shipping_cost', 'weight_kg'], date=shipped_at\n  fct_shipment_item: source=shipment_items, dim_keys=['shipment_id', 'sales_order_item_id', 'product_variant_id', 'from_location_id'], measures=['quantity_shipped'], date=created_at\n\nPipeline context:\n  Industry: logistics / warehouse_management\n  Metrics:  inventory_on_hand, order_fulfillment_rate, receiving_accuracy, pick_pack_cycle_time, shipping_cost_per_order, inventory_turnover\n  Goals:    inventory_accuracy_tracking, order_fulfillment_performance, receiving_and_putaway_efficiency, shipment_and_carrier_analysis\n  Grain:    order_line"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"gold\": [{\"name\": \"agg_daily_purchase_order_cost\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_purchase_order\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"order_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"supplier_id\", \"warehouse_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_shipping_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"shipping_cost\"}, {\"name\": \"total_purchase_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_cost\"}, {\"name\": \"order_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_purchase_order_cost\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_purchase_order\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"order_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"supplier_id\", \"warehouse_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_shipping_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"shipping_cost\"}, {\"name\": \"total_purchase_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_cost\"}, {\"name\": \"order_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_order_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"total_cost\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_purchase_order_item_receiving\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_purchase_order_item\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"expected_delivery_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"purchase_order_id\", \"product_variant_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_ordered\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_ordered\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_received\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_received\"}, {\"name\": \"total_line_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"line_total\"}, {\"name\": \"total_receiving_variance_qty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"receiving_variance_qty\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_unit_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"unit_cost\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_purchase_order_item_receiving\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_purchase_order_item\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"expected_delivery_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"product_variant_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_ordered\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_ordered\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_received\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_received\"}, {\"name\": \"total_line_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"line_total\"}, {\"name\": \"total_receiving_variance_qty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"receiving_variance_qty\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_purchase_orders\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"purchase_order_id\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_receipt_volume\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_receipt\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"receipt_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"purchase_order_id\", \"warehouse_id\", \"receiving_zone_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"receipt_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_purchase_orders\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"purchase_order_id\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_receipt_volume\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_receipt\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"receipt_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\", \"receiving_zone_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"receipt_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_purchase_orders\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"purchase_order_id\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_receipt_item_accuracy\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_receipt_item\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"expiry_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"receipt_id\", \"product_variant_id\", \"destination_location_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_received\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_received\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_accepted\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_accepted\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_rejected\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_rejected\"}, {\"name\": \"total_rejection_qty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"rejection_qty\"}, {\"name\": \"line_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_receipt_item_accuracy\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_receipt_item\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"expiry_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"product_variant_id\", \"destination_location_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_received\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_received\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_accepted\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_accepted\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_rejected\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_rejected\"}, {\"name\": \"total_rejection_qty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"rejection_qty\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_receipts\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"receipt_id\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_inventory_on_hand\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_inventory\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"received_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\", \"location_id\", \"product_variant_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_on_hand\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_on_hand\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_reserved\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_reserved\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_available\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_available\"}, {\"name\": \"total_inventory_value\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"inventory_value\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_unit_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"unit_cost\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_inventory_on_hand\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_inventory\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"received_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\", \"product_variant_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_on_hand\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_on_hand\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_reserved\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_reserved\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_available\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_available\"}, {\"name\": \"total_inventory_value\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"inventory_value\"}, {\"name\": \"min_unit_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"MIN\", \"column\": \"unit_cost\"}, {\"name\": \"max_unit_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"MAX\", \"column\": \"unit_cost\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_inventory_movement\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_inventory_movement\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"movement_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\", \"product_variant_id\", \"from_location_id\", \"to_location_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_moved\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"movement_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_inventory_movement\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_inventory_movement\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"movement_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\", \"product_variant_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_moved\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"movement_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_quantity_per_movement\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_sales_order_revenue\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_sales_order\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"order_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_revenue\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_amount\"}, {\"name\": \"order_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_sales_order_revenue\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_sales_order\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"order_date\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_revenue\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_amount\"}, {\"name\": \"order_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_order_value\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"total_amount\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_sales_order_fulfillment\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_sales_order_item\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"created_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"sales_order_id\", \"product_variant_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_ordered\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_ordered\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_picked\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_picked\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_shipped\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_shipped\"}, {\"name\": \"total_line_revenue\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"line_total\"}, {\"name\": \"total_unfulfilled_qty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"unfulfilled_qty\"}, {\"name\": \"line_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_sales_order_item_fulfillment\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_sales_order_item\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"created_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"sales_order_id\", \"product_variant_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_ordered\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_ordered\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity_shipped\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_shipped\"}, {\"name\": \"total_unfulfilled_qty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"unfulfilled_qty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_line_revenue\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"line_total\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_unit_price\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"unit_price\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_picking_task_volume\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_picking_task\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"started_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"sales_order_id\", \"warehouse_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"picking_task_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_sales_orders\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"sales_order_id\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_picking_task_volume\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_picking_task\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"started_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"picking_task_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_sales_orders\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"sales_order_id\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_packing_task_volume\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_packing_task\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"started_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"sales_order_id\", \"warehouse_id\", \"packing_location_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"packing_task_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"total_weight_kg\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_weight_kg\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_weight_kg\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"total_weight_kg\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_sales_orders\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"sales_order_id\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_packing_task_volume\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_packing_task\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"started_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\", \"packing_location_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"packing_task_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"total_weight_kg\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_weight_kg\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_weight_kg\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"total_weight_kg\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_sales_orders\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"sales_order_id\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_shipment_cost\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_shipment\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"shipped_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\", \"carrier_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_shipping_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"shipping_cost\"}, {\"name\": \"total_weight_kg\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"weight_kg\"}, {\"name\": \"shipment_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_sales_orders\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"sales_order_id\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_shipping_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"shipping_cost\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_shipment_cost\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_shipment\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"shipped_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"warehouse_id\", \"carrier_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_shipping_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"shipping_cost\"}, {\"name\": \"total_weight_kg\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"weight_kg\"}, {\"name\": \"shipment_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_sales_orders\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"sales_order_id\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_shipping_cost_per_order\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"shipping_cost\"}, {\"name\": \"min_shipping_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"MIN\", \"column\": \"shipping_cost\"}, {\"name\": \"max_shipping_cost\", \"aggregation\": \"MAX\", \"column\": \"shipping_cost\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_shipment_item_volume\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_shipment_item\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"created_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"shipment_id\", \"product_variant_id\", \"from_location_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_shipped\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_shipped\"}, {\"name\": \"line_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_shipments\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"shipment_id\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_shipment_item_volume\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_shipment_item\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"created_at\", \"dimensions\": [\"product_variant_id\", \"from_location_id\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity_shipped\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity_shipped\"}, {\"name\": \"line_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"distinct_shipments\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"shipment_id\"}]}]}"}]}
